Changes from ConsoleMCP

This work modifies and extends ConsoleMCP. The following files in `src/` are
redistributed from ConsoleMCP's TypeScript implementation and were reworked for
Mixing Station's unified API:

    osc.ts, gateway.ts, mapping.ts, server.ts   derived from ConsoleMCP
    main.ts                                     modified
    discovery.ts, mixingstation.ts,
    msmcp-gateway.ts, msmcp-server.ts           new in this work

